            x: 14,
            y: 25,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Hail, scholars of Alduin! I’ve heard much about your home! I’ve even heard that there are some of you brave enough to stand up to the dark queen."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elrian",
            text: _("Who’re you to ask, stranger? That kind of talk can be dangerous. Did you see what happened to our locked-up friends?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-mad.webp",
            text: _("Who am I? I am Konrad, son of Prince Arand and heir to the throne of Wesnoth! I am Asheviere’s sworn enemy, and would welcome to my cause all who would oppose her!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alyra",
            text: _("Konrad? The one they call “the false prince”! I— I wasn’t even sure you existed!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elrian",
            text: _("Do you really think you can beat the queen? Is your whole rebel army here?!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Seimus",
            text: _("Now now, everybody just calm down. We don’t want any trouble. If you really are Konrad then you’d best leave right now, before the queen’s soldiers catch you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elrian",
            text: _("Don’t listen to him, Konrad. Soldiers from Wesnoth have locked up our friends. They dared to criticize the throne, and now they’ve been both expelled and imprisoned."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elrian",
            text: _("You have to help us rescue them! Many of the older apprentices here think like Seimus, but my friends and I will fight with you!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Elrian,Alyra",
          },
          {
